# Anchored to the repo root: an unanchored `data/` also matched `src/data/`,
# which silently kept source files out of the repo.
# Enquiry data (personal information). Nothing under leads/ is committed except the
# placeholder: per-lead files, the index and its .old/.new copies, quarantine/.
/leads/*
!/leads/.gitkeep
# Backups taken inside the checkout by docs/contact-storage.md.
/leads-backup-*/
/leads.backup-*/
/data/
